---

<section id="materials" class="py-16 bg-gray-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Materials and Style</h2>
    <p class="mb-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      I love to make art that reflects both a pet's personality and their owners.
      When commissioning a portrait, please choose between colored pencils for a
      more realistic style or charcoal for dramatic contrasts.
    </p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/39317/chihuahua-dog-puppy-cute-39317.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750&dpr=2"
          alt="Colored pencil portrait sample"
          class="w-full h-64 object-cover"
        />
        <div class="p-6">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Colored Pencil</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Vibrant, realistic portraits with fine detail and rich colors.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1805164/pexels-photo-1805164.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750&dpr=2"
          alt="Charcoal portrait sample"
          class="w-full h-64 object-cover"
        />
        <div class="p-6">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Charcoal</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Dramatic, moody portraits with strong contrasts and expressive lines.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
